.TH QUIPU-STORE-STATUS 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-store\-status \- Report inactive or enforced native store ownership without adopting
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu store status\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Report inactive or enforced native store ownership without adopting
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
